        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I spent six years writing other people's marketing emails. In 2019 I started a newsletter on the side, then a YouTube channel, then sold my first workshop to forty readers.</p><p>Now I teach what I wish someone had shown me: a calm business around the things you are good at.</p>"
          }
